# Claims Module — Database Schema & EF Core Configuration

## Column Conventions (APPLY TO ALL TABLES — NO EXCEPTIONS)
| Type | Convention |
|---|---|
| Primary Keys | `UNIQUEIDENTIFIER NOT NULL DEFAULT NEWSEQUENTIALID()` — sequential GUIDs |
| Monetary | `DECIMAL(19,4)` — NEVER use `money` or `float` |
| Timestamps | `DATETIMEOFFSET(7)` stored in UTC |
| Short codes | `NVARCHAR(50)` |
| Names | `NVARCHAR(255)` |
| Free text / JSON | `NVARCHAR(MAX)` |
| Soft Delete | `IsDeleted BIT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0` + `DeletedAt DATETIMEOFFSET(7) NULL` — ALL master/transaction tables |
| Audit Columns | `CreatedAt`, `UpdatedAt NULL`, `UserCreated NULL`, `UserModified NULL` — ALL tables |
| Tenant Isolation | `OrganisationId UNIQUEIDENTIFIER NOT NULL` — EVERY business table |
| Optimistic Concurrency | `RowVer ROWVERSION` — aggregate roots only: Claims, ClaimReserveComponents |

## EF Core Rules (Reviewers specifically check these)
- Use ONLY `IEntityTypeConfiguration<T>` Fluent API — NO data annotations for schema
- Global query filter on every soft-deletable entity: `.HasQueryFilter(e => !e.IsDeleted)`
- All decimal: `.HasPrecision(19, 4)`
- ROWVERSION: `.IsRowVersion()`
- GUID PKs: `.HasDefaultValueSql("NEWSEQUENTIALID()")`
- All seed data via `HasData()` in migrations — NOT in application startup
- `dotnet ef database update` must work on a fresh SQL Server instance

## Entity: Claims (Aggregate Root)
```
ClaimId               UNIQUEIDENTIFIER PK NEWSEQUENTIALID()
OrganisationId        UNIQUEIDENTIFIER NOT NULL
ClaimNumber           NVARCHAR(50) NOT NULL UNIQUE
PolicyId              UNIQUEIDENTIFIER NULL
PolicyNumber          NVARCHAR(50) NULL (denormalised)
ClientName            NVARCHAR(255) NULL (denormalised)
Status                NVARCHAR(50) NOT NULL
Severity              NVARCHAR(50) NULL (Catastrophic/Critical/Standard/Minor)
ReportedDate          DATETIMEOFFSET(7) NOT NULL
AssignedHandlerId     UNIQUEIDENTIFIER NULL
ClosedAt              DATETIMEOFFSET(7) NULL
ClosureReason         NVARCHAR(MAX) NULL
Notes                 NVARCHAR(MAX) NULL
ManagerOverrideFlag   BIT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0
IsDeleted BIT + DeletedAt, CreatedAt, UpdatedAt, UserCreated, UserModified, RowVer
```

## Entity: LossEvents
