## Entity: ReserveHistory (APPEND-ONLY — event sourced)
```
ReserveHistoryId      UNIQUEIDENTIFIER PK
ReserveComponentId    UNIQUEIDENTIFIER NOT NULL FK→ClaimReserveComponents
ClaimId               UNIQUEIDENTIFIER NOT NULL FK→Claims (denormalised)
TransactionType       NVARCHAR(50) NOT NULL  (Add/Adjust/Reverse)
Amount                DECIMAL(19,4) NOT NULL  (delta; SubrogationRecoverable may be negative)
PreviousBalance       DECIMAL(19,4) NOT NULL
NewBalance            DECIMAL(19,4) NOT NULL
ApprovalStatus        NVARCHAR(50) NOT NULL  (AutoApproved/PendingApproval/Approved/Rejected/Cancelled)
ApprovedByUserId      UNIQUEIDENTIFIER NULL
ApprovedAt            DATETIMEOFFSET(7) NULL
RejectedByUserId      UNIQUEIDENTIFIER NULL
RejectedAt            DATETIMEOFFSET(7) NULL
RejectionReason       NVARCHAR(MAX) NULL
ChangeReason          NVARCHAR(500) NOT NULL
PostingStatus         NVARCHAR(50) NOT NULL  (Pending/Posted/Failed/Cancelled)
PostingJobId          NVARCHAR(200) NULL  (Hangfire job ID)
IdempotencyKey        NVARCHAR(200) NOT NULL  (Reserve:{ReserveId}:Change:{Seq})
ChangeSequence        INT NOT NULL  (monotonically increasing per component)
SubmittedByUserId     UNIQUEIDENTIFIER NULL
CreatedAt             DATETIMEOFFSET(7) NOT NULL
OrganisationId        UNIQUEIDENTIFIER NOT NULL
```
NOTE: No IsDeleted, no UpdatedAt on this table — append-only

