## Naming conventions (FRS §15.3)

| Layer | Convention |
|---|---|
| Database tables | PascalCase singular noun (`Claims`, `LossEvents`, `ClaimParties`) |
| Database columns | PascalCase (`ClaimId`, `LossDate`, `CauseOfLossCode`) |
| C# entities | PascalCase; match table name |
| C# DTOs / commands | Suffix `Dto` or `Request`/`Response`; MediatR: `VerbNounCommand`, `GetNounQuery`, `ListNounsQuery` |
| API routes | kebab-case plural nouns (`/api/claims`, `/api/reference/cause-of-loss-codes`) |

## Assessment schema name deviations (use FRS names)

- Tenant column: **`OrganisationId`** — not Assessment `OrganizationEntityId`
- Reserve history balances: **`PreviousBalance`**, **`NewBalance`** — not Assessment `PreviousAmount` / `NewAmount`
- No **`ClaimStatusTransitions`** table — transitions enforced in application layer per FRS state machine

